+# Vault HSM Onboarding — Detailed Operational Runbook
+
+Scope
+- Commission AWS CloudHSM (or vendor) for Vault PKCS#11 auto-unseal and production signing.
+- Implement dual‑control key import/activation and rotation procedures.
+- Validate audit and non‑repudiation flows with Vault + Rekor.
+
+Pre-reqs
+- Terraform module configured (vault/terraform/cloudhsm_full.tf) with correct tfvars.
+- Security approval and completed risk assessment.
+- HSM operator accounts and two named approvers (Operator A, Operator B) created.
+- Vault Helm deployed with PKCS#11 values (vault/helm/values-production.yaml).
+
+Phases
+1) Provisioning (SRE)
+   - Run Terraform: terraform init && terraform apply -var-file=secrets.tfvars
+   - Validate cluster id and HSM nodes: aws cloudhsm-v2 describe-clusters --cluster-ids <id>
+   - Ensure SGs allow Vault hosts to connect to HSM control/data ports.
+
+2) HSM Initialization (Security + SRE)
+   - Connect to CloudHSM CLI host (bastion) and run vendor init steps:
+     - Create HSM partitions if needed.
+     - Initialize cluster certificates.
+   - Create HSM operator accounts (A and B) following vendor guidance.
+
+3) Dual-Control Key Import & Activation (Operators A + B)
+   - Operator A: create key in HSM (or import wrapped key). Record key label and fingerprint.
+   - Operator B: independently verify the key fingerprint and sign approval artifact (PGP-signed ticket).
+   - Operator A: provide final activation command referencing Operator B approval to activate key.
+   - Document each step into ticketing system and attach HSM CLI outputs and signed approvals.
+
+4) Vault PKCS#11 Integration (SRE)
+   - Ensure PKCS#11 libs exist on Vault hosts and mounted at /opt/cloudhsm/lib.
+   - Configure Helm values:
+     autoUnseal.pkcs11.lib: "/opt/cloudhsm/lib/libcloudhsm_pkcs11.so"
+     autoUnseal.pkcs11.pin: "REPLACE_WITH_SECURE_PIN"
+     autoUnseal.pkcs11.keyLabel: "<hsm_key_label>"
+   - Deploy and validate: kubectl -n vault exec -it vault-0 -- vault status
+
+5) Transit Key Management & Rotation (Security + SRE)
+   - Create vault transit key that uses HSM key for wrapping as required.
+   - Schedule rotations: use vault/scripts/transit_rotate.sh
+   - Test rollback procedure with emergency unseal keys stored in sealed escrow vault (multi‑party).
+
+6) Audit & Rekor integration (SRE + Security)
+   - Ensure Vault audit device configured; forward to SIEM.
+   - For mission-critical signed outputs, sign with Vault Transit and then record signature + metadata to Rekor for non‑repudiation.
+
+7) Validation & DR test (SRE)
+   - Auto-unseal failover test: run vault/scripts/auto_unseal_failover.sh
+   - Record logs and verify HSM audit entries.
+   - Test Rekor restore drill (ops/rekor/restore_drill_playbook.md).
+
+8) Handover & Runbook signoff
+   - Security approves key custody & access controls.
+   - On-call runbooks verified; emergency contact list updated.
+
+Appendices
